   <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_ophost</strong></td>\n                        <td>❌ FAILED</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opapi</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_kernel</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opgraph</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/2686/slog.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table>","created_at":"2026-03-13T16:52:47+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T16:59:01+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165209371,"discussion_id":"8c52ff3f3bea545e51d3eba0d3936fdb0d298ec5","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化ScatterElementsV2算子在确定性模式下的内存使用效率。原实现中，用于排序的临时缓冲区大小计算采用了固定的常量（`MAX_SORT_SPACE`），这种静态分配方式无法适应不同排序维度和数据类型的实际需求，可能导致内存浪费或分配不足。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改是重写了 `GetMaxSortTmpBuf` 函数的实现。新方案摒弃了返回固定最大空间的做法，改为根据传入的实际排序维度（`sortDim`）动态构造排序任务，并调用 `GetSortMaxMinTmpSize` 接口来计算该特定任务所需的最大临时缓冲区大小。这使得内存分配与具体任务规模精确匹配，提升了内存利用率和算法的适应性。","created_at":"2026-03-13T16:56:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T16:56:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165218102,"discussion_id":"979d2fb3a8c04f33d4d418103f0e0f2b7c7d8ae0","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-13T17:30:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T17:30:54+08:00","user":{"id":"6773bab08aed3e230a2e1e77","login":"lvmengge","object_id":"6773bab08aed3e230a2e1e77","name":"lvmengge","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ce/eb/1643c560e83eb3d91e7257675adf73d3f28bf7e92846f72900a5847977b4f3a9.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/lvmengge"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165218191,"discussion_id":"66caea60af9747b5a88b476b7aa609228173b514","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-13T17:31:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T17:31:15+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165218392,"discussion_id":"d745375e43865463e104325e9e1cfbf2c01364dc","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=c4df2ea3710